        <updated>2026-06-14T13:37:00-07:00</updated>
            <summary type="html">
                <![CDATA[
                        <img src="https://www.jujubemonster.com/media/posts/108/roar.png" alt="" />
                    you shattered me into a thousand tiny pieces of my untamed self, and for once, i roared. — Jadine Lydia
                ]]>
            </summary>
        <content type="html">
            <![CDATA[
                    <p><img src="https://www.jujubemonster.com/media/posts/108/roar.png" class="type:primaryImage" alt="" /></p>
                <p class="wp-block-paragraph">you shattered me<br>into a thousand tiny pieces<br>of my untamed self,<br>and for once,<br>i roared.</p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">— Jadine Lydia</p>
